<div class="grid gap-12 lg:gap-16 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,22rem)] lg:items-start">
  <div class="space-y-8">
    <p class="text-sm font-medium text-primary uppercase tracking-widest">Real-time community</p>
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance leading-tight">
      Chat that stays fast at any scale.
    </h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-base-content/75 max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
      Beam Chat is built for rooms, direct messages, and live presence—powered by Phoenix and LiveView so your UI stays responsive without shipping a separate SPA.
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 sm:items-center">
      <a href={~p"/auth/register"} class="btn btn-primary btn-lg px-8">Create an account</a>
      <a href={~p"/auth/login"} class="btn btn-outline btn-lg border-base-300">Sign in</a>
    </div>
    <dl class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6 pt-4 border-t border-base-300/80 max-w-lg">
      <div>
        <dt class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-base-content/50">
          Transport
        </dt>
        <dd class="mt-1 font-display text-lg font-semibold">WebSockets</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-base-content/50">Stack</dt>
        <dd class="mt-1 font-display text-lg font-semibold">Elixir · LiveView</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="col-span-2 sm:col-span-1">
        <dt class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-base-content/50">Themes</dt>
        <dd class="mt-1 font-display text-lg font-semibold">Light · Dark · System</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>

  <aside class="card bg-base-200/40 border border-base-300/80 shadow-lg shadow-base-300/20 rounded-box p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-6">
    <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold">What ships next</h2>
    <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm text-base-content/80">
      <li class="flex gap-3">
        <span class="mt-0.5 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/15 text-primary text-xs font-bold">
          1
        </span>
        <span>Clustered room processes, presence, and moderated message pipelines.</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex gap-3">
        <span class="mt-0.5 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/15 text-primary text-xs font-bold">
          2
        </span>
        <span>Wallet-backed subscriptions and integrations tuned for your market.</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex gap-3">
        <span class="mt-0.5 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/15 text-primary text-xs font-bold">
          3
        </span>
        <span>
          Design tokens stay aligned with Figma—see <code class="text-xs bg-base-300/50 px-1 rounded">DESIGN_SYSTEM.md</code>.
        </span>
      </li>
    </ul>
    <div class="rounded-box bg-base-100/60 border border-base-300/60 p-4 text-xs text-base-content/65 leading-relaxed">
      API health check: <a href="/health" class="link link-primary font-medium">GET /health</a>
    </div>
  </aside>
</div>
